{
  "description": "This is a flexible protocol accommodating a wide range of PCR setups. Mastermix is transferred from a 2ml snapcap tube to clean PCR plate using a P20 GEN2 single-channel pipette. Then, a P20 GEN2 multi-channel pipette transfers eluates from RNA extraction to the PCR plate containing mastermix. Samples are transferred to their corresponding positions from plate to plate (A1 to A1, B1, to B1, etc.)",
  "tags": [
    "generic_station_C.ot2.apiv2.py",
    "PCR",
    "PCR Prep"
